# System Architecture

Gameplay logic must be implemented as **standalone systems**.

Rules:

• Each major feature → its own ModuleScript  
• Systems must have a clear API  
• Systems must not directly manipulate UI  

Example system structure:

RoundSystem  
SpawnSystem  
InventorySystem  
RewardSystem  

UI must interact with systems instead of implementing gameplay logic.

Avoid:

- giant scripts
- tightly coupled modules
- UI-driven game logic
